Scope: this license applies to the original .NET 10 port of the Adobe DNG SDK
contained in this repository — specifically `src/`, `tests/`, `tools/`, and
other files outside the vendored reference tree.

This repository references (but does not include) Adobe's DNG SDK 1.7.1 and
its bundled third-party components (libjpeg, libjxl and its dependencies,
Adobe XMP Toolkit) as an external, locally-obtained dependency used for
building golden-file references and reading spec-derived constants. That
vendored tree is not part of this repository and is not covered by this
license; see `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md` for details on its licensing.
